| Shared metadata/conditions/families/scopes | Proposal conditions, program stages and finite assignments; full inventory including height-bake and isolated fixtures | `ConditionReader`, `ProgramReader`; group/reference attributes, explicit uses and rows; shared-key/condition/family/scope tests; representative migrated owners |
| Semantic generation/settings hook | Proposal generator and runtime ownership boundary | `ShaderDeclarationGenerator`, `DeclarationEmitter`, `GpuProgram.Options`, `ShaderOptionAccess`; existing `ShaderSettings` and `RequestRecompile`; generated-code execution and focused accessor tests |
